    "usage": {
      "status": "verified",
      "verifiedAt": "2026-06-10",
      "resultPull": "sync",
      "auth": "none",
      "callShape": "GET https://api.x402node.dev/image/ocr?url=<IMAGE_URL>&lang=eng (x402 v1 paid, ~$0.01 USDC on Base). Input is via query params, NOT a JSON body. For the strale gateway: GET https://api.strale.io/x402/image-to-text?image_url=<IMAGE_URL> (or ?base64=<B64>), ~$0.054 USDC on Base.",
      "inputExample": {
        "url": "https://tesseract.projectnaptha.com/img/eng_bw.png",
        "lang": "eng"
      },
      "outputShape": "x402node: body.text (string), body.confidence (number 0-100), body.lang, body.lines_count, body.words_count, body.processing_ms, body.file_size_bytes. strale: body.text, body.text_type, body.confidence (string), body.language_detected.",
      "quirks": [
        "BOTH backends are GET-with-query-params. Registry recorded strale as POST but its own 402 outputSchema declares GET queryParams (base64|image_url) — POST/JSON-body is wrong for both.",
        "x402node: method is GET; POST returns 404 'Cannot POST /image/ocr'. Image supplied via ?url= query param (publicly reachable image URL).",
        "x402node uses x402 v1 (no top-level accepts array) — agentcash fetch CANNOT pay it ('parse_payment_required'/'x402 v1 not supported'). Pay via qa-pay or a raw x402 v1 client.",
        "x402node lines_count and words_count came back 0 even though text was extracted — rely on body.text and body.confidence, NOT the count fields.",
        "x402node optional ?lang= (default eng); supports eng, chi, jpn, kor, deu, fra, spa, ita.",
        "strale takes EITHER ?image_url= or ?base64= (base64-encoded image); confidence is returned as a string and it adds language_detected/text_type fields.",
        "Despite the registry name 'Image & PDF to Text', only image OCR is verified — PDF support is unverified on both gateways.",
        "Orbis backend (orbisapi.com proxy) DROPPED: known charge-then-404 payment trap, do-not-register."
      ],
      "needs": [],
      "needsApproval": false,
      "guide": "Extract text from an image via OCR. Supply a publicly reachable image URL; returns the extracted text plus a confidence score. x402node runs Tesseract; strale runs Claude vision (better on handwriting/photos). Same operation via two gateways. GET https://api.x402node.dev/image/ocr?url=<IMAGE_URL>&lang=eng (x402 v1 paid, ~$0.01 USDC on Base). Input is via query params, NOT a JSON body. For the strale gateway: GET https://api.strale.io/x402/image-to-text?image_url=<IMAGE_URL> (or ?base64=<B64>), ~$0.054 USDC on Base. Output: x402node: body.text (string), body.confidence (number 0-100), body.lang, body.lines_count, body.words_count, body.processing_ms, body.file_size_bytes. strale: body.text, body.text_type, body.confidence (string), body.language_detected.",
      "costObservedUsd": 0.01
    },
